      <Parameter>
         <Name>FITS Extension #1 Brightness Data Array</Name>
         <Description>PUNCH Level 3 polarized K-corona mosaic stored as a compressed three-dimensional floating-point image cube with three image layers: total brightness (B), polarized brightness (pB), and the conjugate polarized brightness component (pB&#039;). The data array dimensions are 4096 x 4096 x 3. The FITS header provides helioprojective longitude and latitude coordinates with an ARC projection and an alternate ICRS right ascension and declination coordinate system with a STOKES third axis. The pixel scale is 0.0225 degrees, or 81 arcsec, at the reference point. The nominal wavelength is 530 nm. The reference time is specified by the DATE-OBS FITS keyword.</Description>
         <Units>2.009e+07 W m^-2 sr^-1</Units>
